==Strategy==
This stage is essentially a slightly harder version of [[Empire of Cats]] Ch.2's [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] Outbreak. None of the enemies in this stage pose a serious threat, as the zombies have such a low magnification that there's no reason to actually worry about them. A strategy similarly employed there works here.

==Trivia==
*Cursed Equipment likely references specific items from [[Wikipedia:Dragon Quest|Dragon Quest]] that, as the name implies, are powerful weapons or armor pieces that are cursed and will inflict misfortune on those who equip them.

